{"product_id":"my-little-pony-fluttershy-and-the-fine-furry-friends-fair","title":"My Little Pony: Fluttershy and the Fine Furry Friends Fair","description":"\u003cp\u003eFluttershy is shocked to discover that her pet bunny, Angel, wants to enter the annual Fine Furry Friends Fair herding contest! Who's ever heard of a bunny herding cows and sheep? Fluttershy agrees to train him, but their first practice is a disaster. Fluttershy is too afraid of failure to continue, until all her friends bring something special to help out.© 2015 Hasbro. All Rights Reserved.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: G.M. Berrow\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780316277198\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 144\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45834337190041,"sku":"17RD-39780316277198","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ff73dfa5245_My_Little_Pony-_Fluttershy_and_the_Fine_Furry_Friends_Fair_G.M._Berrow.jpg?v=1761588305","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/my-little-pony-fluttershy-and-the-fine-furry-friends-fair","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}